source: crates/m2-server-core/tests/skills.rs
expression: h.log
---
@1000 conn#1 accepted on auth from 10.0.0.1
   -> event: conn#1: accepted on auth
@1000 conn#1 sends Hello protocol=3 "openm2 test"
   -> event: conn#1: openm2 test speaks protocol 3
   -> send conn#1 Welcome protocol=3
@1000 conn#1 sends StartSignIn
   -> send conn#1 SignInOptions [example] nonce="f400927857aaf64114f561baacb37970"
@1000 conn#1 sends ProviderLogin example http://127.0.0.1:50000/callback
   -> check sign-in #1: example http://127.0.0.1:50000/callback nonce=f400927857aaf64114f561baacb37970
@1000 sign-in #1 checked: https://id.example alice
   -> store #2: identity login example https://id.example alice
@1000 store answers #2: login ok, account 1 None
   -> event: conn#1: account 1 signed in with example
   -> send conn#1 SignedIn example:alice 8c79… (32 bytes)
@1000 conn#1 closed: the client left
   -> event: conn#1: closed: the client left
@1000 conn#2 accepted on game from 10.0.0.1
   -> event: conn#2: accepted on game
@1000 conn#2 sends Hello protocol=3 "openm2 test"
   -> event: conn#2: openm2 test speaks protocol 3
   -> send conn#2 Welcome protocol=3
@1000 conn#2 sends TicketLogin example:alice 8c79… (32 bytes)
   -> event: conn#2: account 1 joined the game server
   -> store #3: load characters of 1
@1000 store answers #3: characters []
   -> send conn#2 Empire 0
   -> send conn#2 Phase 1
   -> send conn#2 CharacterList []
-- a new character starts at level 5 with 4 skill points and 12 status points
@1000 conn#2 sends CreateCharacter slot=0 Alice class=0 empire=1
   -> store #4: create Alice for 1 in slot 0 at (475000, 966100) empire 1
@1000 store answers #4: created #1 Alice in slot 0
   -> event: conn#2: character 1 created
   -> send conn#2 CharacterCreated slot=0 #1 Alice class=0 st=6 ht=4 dx=3 iq=3
@1000 conn#2 sends SelectCharacter 0
   -> send conn#2 Phase 2
   -> send conn#2 MainCharacter vid=4 Alice class=0 (475000, 966100) empire=1 group=0 run=450
   -> send conn#2 Points 1=5 4=5500 5=940 6=940 7=480 8=480 12=6 13=4 14=3 15=3 16=8 17=100 18=22 19=150 20=8 26=12 27=1 28=4
@1000 conn#2 sends EnterGame
   -> send conn#2 Phase 3
   -> send conn#2 GameTime 1000
   -> send conn#2 Channel 1
   -> send conn#2 EntitySpawn vid=4 (475000, 966100) kind=6 race=0 angle=0 speed=150/100
   -> send conn#2 EntityInfo vid=4 Alice empire=1 level=5
   -> send conn#2 Skills
   -> send conn#2 Chat kind=1 vid=0 "You can choose your skills now: /skillgroup 1 or 2"
   -> event: conn#2: character 1 entered as vid 4
   -> send conn#2 EntitySpawn vid=1 (475070, 966362) kind=0 race=1001 angle=210 speed=100/100
   -> send conn#2 EntitySpawn vid=2 (474966, 966177) kind=0 race=1001 angle=215 speed=100/100
   -> send conn#2 EntitySpawn vid=3 (474980, 966176) kind=0 race=1001 angle=145 speed=100/100
-- no group yet: no skill points can be spent
@1000 conn#2 sends RaiseSkill 1
   -> send conn#2 Chat kind=1 vid=0 "Choose a skill group first: /skillgroup 1 or 2"
-- the group is 1 or 2
@1000 conn#2 sends SendChat kind=0 "/skillgroup"
   -> send conn#2 Chat kind=1 vid=0 "Choose skill group 1 or 2: /skillgroup 1"
@1000 conn#2 sends SendChat kind=0 "/skillgroup 3"
   -> send conn#2 Chat kind=1 vid=0 "Choose skill group 1 or 2: /skillgroup 1"
@1000 conn#2 sends SendChat kind=0 "/skillgroup 1"
   -> send conn#2 SkillGroup 1
   -> event: conn#2: character 1 chose skill group 1
-- chosen once only
@1000 conn#2 sends SendChat kind=0 "/skillgroup 2"
   -> send conn#2 Chat kind=1 vid=0 "You have chosen your skill group already."
-- saved, and in MainCharacter at the next selection
@1000 conn#2 closed: the client left
   -> store #5: save #1 at (475000, 966100) played 0s group=1
   -> event: conn#2: closed: the client left
